# FAN: Tokenizer (EFC_Brain_Tokenizer)

```yaml
efc_id:   "EFC_BRAIN_TOK_001"
efc_name: "brain_tokenizer_bpe"
rfn:      "RFN://brain.tokenizer.bpe_gguf"

input:
  I1: "text: &str â€” raw prompt text"
  I2: "loaded_model: &LoadedModel â€” GGUF with tokenizer KV"

process:
  P1: "Extract vocab + merges from GGUF metadata KV"
  P2: "Construct tokenizers::Tokenizer from vocab/merges"
  P3: "encode(text) -> Vec<u32>"

output:
  O1: "token_ids: Vec<u32>"
  O2: "TokenizerMeta { vocab_size, bos_id, eos_id, model_type }"

error:
  E1: "TokenizerError::VocabNotLoaded â€” GGUF missing tokenizer.ggml.tokens"
  E2: "TokenizerError::EncodeFailed   â€” tokenizers crate returns error"

feh_inputs:  [text_utf8, vocab_hash, merges_hash]
feh_outputs: [token_ids_sha256]

crate_path:    "brain/master/src/tokenizer/mod.rs"
delegate_none: "tokenizer is brain/master owned â€” no hacedle delegation"
dep_required:  "tokenizers = 0.19 in brain/master/Cargo.toml"

test_fixture: "audit/fixtures/hello_tokens.json"
test_cmd:     "hace brain tokenize 'hello' -> [9707]"
```

