# FAN: Decode (EFC_Brain_Detokenizer)

```yaml
efc_id:   "EFC_BRAIN_DETOK_001"
rfn:      "RFN://brain.tokenizer.bpe_decode"

input:    "token_ids: &[u32]"
output:   "text: String"
error:    "TokenizerError::DecodeFailed"

test_cmd: "hace brain detokenize 9707 -> 'hello'"
```
